WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.141 --> 00:01:17.197
song The pals drive on the road.

2
00:01:19.998 --> 00:01:22.259
Red: Stop the car!

3
00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:23.940
I see Mark!

4
00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:28.683
Mark: Can you give me a ride?

5
00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:30.844
Green: Yes!

6
00:01:31.284 --> 00:01:32.125
Get in the car.

7
00:01:32.145 --> 00:01:37.648
Mark: Please take me north.

8
00:01:44.111 --> 00:01:45.432
The car goes north.

9
00:01:54.604 --> 00:01:55.585
Blue: Oh no!

10
00:01:56.065 --> 00:01:57.265
It is a storm!

11
00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.670
Look, there is a farm.

12
00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:12.112
Green: And I see a barn!

13
00:02:14.473 --> 00:02:16.174
The pals and Mark run.

14
00:02:16.194 --> 00:02:19.936
Pals: It's too far!

15
00:02:23.188 --> 00:02:24.529
Pink: I see a horse.

16
00:02:30.235 --> 00:02:31.616
They ride the horse.

17
00:02:33.758 --> 00:02:35.039
They come to the barn.

18
00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:40.484
Red: Wow!

19
00:02:40.825 --> 00:02:43.067
There is so much corn!

20
00:02:43.087 --> 00:02:47.411
Blue: Let's eat!

21
00:02:59.344 --> 00:03:01.046
Soon the storm stops.

22
00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:09.113
Mark: Let's go back to the road.
